    "statement": "The from-action a_2 (extracted via the identity b_3 = 2(a_1' - a_2) applied to the independent Q/EL_A structure) equals a_2^H (Horndeski part) to FD precision at all sampled radii, NOT the printed a_2 = a_2^H - 2 pi'^3 F_4: the printed a_2^BH = 2 sqrt(AB^3) pi'^3 F_4 is spurious, confirming F4-2's second finding independently. In the independent derivation the identity itself holds exactly: EL_A = D_r Q with nu = 0 and residuals at FD floor (see profile ELA_resid_max)."
